    <templateVersions>
        <content>Convert the Appointment Slot From UTC to the given Time Zone.
Slot: {!$Input:Appointment_Slot}
TIimeZone:{!$Input:TimeZone}

If big data with multiple datetime is given convert all

Example : Input:  2025-04-30 02:30:00Z - 2025-04-30 03:30:00Z Time Zone: Asia/Kolkata
Output for datetime. but apply for all data. Include all data in output with just datetime replaced: 2025-04-30 08:00 - 2025-04-30 09:00 
Note do it in 24hr time



</content>
